flowchart TB
classDef plain fill:#ffffff,stroke:#222222,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111
classDef stop fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px,color:#111111
A["1. Look: 8 seeds, CO3 and the fix<br/>from the same starting noise<br/>about 5 GPU-minutes"]:::plain
B{"Does the fix change<br/>any picture visibly?"}:::plain
C["2. Pilot: 24 paired pictures<br/>catches a big win (CO3 10% to 50%)<br/>9 times in 10, about 15 GPU-minutes"]:::plain
D{"More wins than losses<br/>on the pairs that differ?"}:::plain
E["3. Confirm: 96 paired pictures<br/>catches 10% to 30%<br/>almost always, about 1 GPU-hour"]:::plain
F["4. Benchmark: winner only,<br/>full prompt set, the paper's table"]:::plain
X["Park it, with the size of win<br/>this sample could have seen"]:::stop
A --> B
B -- yes --> C
B -- no --> X
C --> D
D -- yes --> E
D -- no --> X
E --> F
